{"id":"d294bc41854750f6","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-card-dedekind-infinite.md","title":"ZFC Card Dedekind Infinite","display":"df-zfc-card-dedekind-infinite — ZFC Card Dedekind Infinite","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-card-dedekind-infinite","aliases":["58-df-zfc-card-dedekind-infinite"],"display":"df-zfc-card-dedekind-infinite — ZFC Card Dedekind Infinite","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-injection]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-card-dedekind-infinite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-card-dedekind-infinite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-card-dedekind-infinite — ZFC Card Dedekind Infinite"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"58-df-injection\">58-df-injection</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injection}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\)</span> (injection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"58-df-injection\">58-df-injection</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCardDedekindInfinite}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCardDedekindInfinite}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}infinite} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardDedekindInfinite}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow \\exists B\\in\\mathcal P(A)\\;\\Bigl(B\\neq A\\land\\exists f\\;(\\mathrm{Injection}_S(f,A,B)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=B)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}infinite} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardDedekindInfinite}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow \\exists B\\in\\mathcal P(A)\\;\\Bigl(B\\neq A\\land\\exists f\\;(\\mathrm{Injection}_S(f,A,B)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=B)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The proper-subset witness is bound only in the assertion; the earlier hypothesis shadowed the quantified variable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-injection","status":"resolved","id":"f5a60b2c6e668b3e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-injection]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-injection","status":"resolved","id":"f5a60b2c6e668b3e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Injection}_S$ (injection predicate, see [[58-df-injection]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injection}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCardDedekindInfinite}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}infinite} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardDedekindInfinite}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow \\exists B\\in\\mathcal P(A)\\;\\Bigl(B\\neq A\\land\\exists f\\;(\\mathrm{Injection}_S(f,A,B)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=B)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":910,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1481","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-card-dedekind-infinite.md|58-df-zfc-card-dedekind-infinite]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","f5a60b2c6e668b3e"]}